WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:41.560
Archers!

01:44.880 --> 01:46.120
EAST GATE

01:52.040 --> 01:53.800
This is a fight to the death.

01:54.760 --> 01:56.480
There's no need to think about surviving!

01:56.960 --> 02:00.800
Xiao Heng, you've been abandoned!

02:00.880 --> 02:02.680
Who said he's abandoned?

02:21.720 --> 02:22.840
Hold your arrows!

02:27.520 --> 02:29.360
Stop looking. There are no reinforcements.

02:29.920 --> 02:31.040
It's just me.

02:31.120 --> 02:32.560
Do you have a death wish?

02:44.160 --> 02:46.080
I told you, I won't abandon you.

02:47.080 --> 02:47.920
I'd come to you.

02:51.760 --> 02:54.840
I've fulfilled my life's purpose.

02:55.400 --> 02:56.480
I have no more regrets.

02:57.400 --> 03:00.720
I, Xue Fangfei, have no regrets

03:01.920 --> 03:04.240
in dying for Great Yan today.

03:05.360 --> 03:07.840
Shen Yurong, I'll allow you

03:08.480 --> 03:09.680
to kill me once more today.

03:15.360 --> 03:16.320
Xue Li,

03:17.440 --> 03:20.480
I once wanted
to sacrifice myself for Great Yan,

03:21.000 --> 03:23.040
but the imperial family
could crush you and me

03:23.120 --> 03:25.000
as if we were ants.

03:26.200 --> 03:28.680
Would anyone remember what I did?

03:29.520 --> 03:30.560
No!

03:31.920 --> 03:34.720
So what's the point of us
dying for Great Yan?

03:35.560 --> 03:37.360
No one will remember.

03:37.920 --> 03:38.760
Xue Li,

03:40.720 --> 03:41.680
kill Xiao Heng

03:43.320 --> 03:44.760
and we'll live on,

03:46.200 --> 03:47.400
just like we used to.

03:48.080 --> 03:48.920
Shen Yurong,

03:51.040 --> 03:51.880
you're wrong.

03:53.400 --> 03:54.720
Someone will remember.

03:58.200 --> 03:59.560
Prince Cheng abandoned

04:01.360 --> 04:03.000
Wang City in the north and retreated,

04:03.080 --> 04:04.440
disregarding the people.

04:05.360 --> 04:08.360
At the valley passage, to ensure
the people could evacuate safely,

04:08.440 --> 04:10.000
a hundred Longwu soldiers

04:10.560 --> 04:14.400
fought to the death,
not thinking of surviving.

04:15.400 --> 04:18.240
We remember the names of the soldiers!

04:22.640 --> 04:25.960
We call the 100 heroic spirits
of Longwu soldiers outside Wang City!

04:27.360 --> 04:28.640
Xiao Minghan!

04:28.720 --> 04:29.720
General Xiao.

04:30.440 --> 04:31.440
Peng Guang!

04:32.000 --> 04:32.840
Vice General Peng.

04:33.680 --> 04:34.920
Zhao Decheng!

04:35.000 --> 04:35.880
My brother.

04:37.200 --> 04:38.120
Huang Junchu!

04:39.760 --> 04:40.880
Zhang Che!

04:41.680 --> 04:42.840
Li Licheng!

04:43.920 --> 04:45.080
Qian Ziming!

04:54.480 --> 04:57.600
The loyal soul of Great Yan, Xiao Heng!

05:02.960 --> 05:04.240
Xue Fangfei!

05:04.800 --> 05:05.640
Stop it!

05:09.760 --> 05:11.120
Archers!

05:27.560 --> 05:30.440
Shen Yurong, I'll show you
what the army of Great Zhao

05:30.520 --> 05:31.680
is capable of today.

05:32.960 --> 05:35.800
Yang Qing, get ready for battle.

05:40.480 --> 05:41.440
Yang Qing!

05:42.200 --> 05:45.360
The fish talisman is here
and those who disobey my order will die!

05:52.320 --> 05:54.760
Longwu Army, come with me.

06:06.640 --> 06:08.400
Duke Su, a military order must be obeyed.

06:09.160 --> 06:11.600
The Longwu Army only acknowledges
the fish talisman.

06:12.160 --> 06:15.000
Xiao Heng, look at the Longwu Army here.

06:15.080 --> 06:16.880
Do you really want to kill them?

06:19.800 --> 06:20.960
Don't listen to his crap.

06:21.040 --> 06:22.440
Why don't we strike first?

06:22.520 --> 06:24.160
Among these soldiers

06:24.240 --> 06:26.840
are those your father personally guided.

06:27.640 --> 06:30.560
The army of Great Zhao is your ally.

06:31.120 --> 06:33.440
Are you really going
to let your allied forces

06:33.520 --> 06:36.360
fight against the Longwu Army?

06:38.480 --> 06:42.920
Xiao Heng, you've been so arrogant
all your life and were never defeated.

06:43.400 --> 06:45.720
But in the end,
you couldn't protect anyone.

06:47.280 --> 06:49.280
How can you compete with me?

06:55.560 --> 06:59.120
The holder of the fish talisman shall die!
Longwu Army, remove your armor!

07:00.920 --> 07:01.800
Xue Li,

07:04.280 --> 07:06.280
your hands are for playing the guqin,

07:07.640 --> 07:09.120
not for holding arrows.

07:09.680 --> 07:12.760
You're the one
who forced me to learn archery.

07:21.720 --> 07:22.880
Yang Qing!

07:24.560 --> 07:25.880
Whoever disobeys

07:27.480 --> 07:29.600
will die!

07:31.080 --> 07:33.960
Focus on the target. I'll count to three.

07:34.040 --> 07:35.120
Together, let's release

07:35.600 --> 07:37.160
the thumb that's pulling the string.

07:38.120 --> 07:39.760
Remember, don't hesitate.

07:40.280 --> 07:41.400
One,

07:41.880 --> 07:42.720
two,

07:43.280 --> 07:44.240
three.

07:50.920 --> 07:52.280
Xiao Heng, catch it.

08:02.280 --> 08:05.480
How did you know
the names of these people?

08:06.080 --> 08:08.040
General Xiao told me.

08:14.960 --> 08:15.960
Xiao Heng,

08:17.360 --> 08:18.600
can you let it go now?

08:29.400 --> 08:33.400
Xiao Heng, lead General Xiao's Longwu Army

08:35.080 --> 08:36.120
to fight our way back.

08:36.720 --> 08:37.880
Duke Su,

08:37.960 --> 08:40.200
please lead the Longwu Army
to fight our way back!

08:40.280 --> 08:41.320
- Fight our way back!
- Fight our way back!

08:41.400 --> 08:42.720
Take revenge for General Xiao!

08:42.799 --> 08:45.280
- Revenge!
- Revenge!

08:45.360 --> 08:47.440
Take revenge
for the fallen Longwu warriors!

08:47.520 --> 08:50.240
Avenge the fallen Longwu warriors!

08:50.320 --> 08:53.360
Take revenge
for the fallen Longwu warriors!

08:53.440 --> 08:56.760
- Revenge!
- Revenge!

08:56.840 --> 08:59.680
Jiuyue, please lead your troops

08:59.760 --> 09:01.280
to wipe out rebels outside the city.

09:01.360 --> 09:02.640
Leave that to me.

09:13.800 --> 09:14.840
I'll wait for your return.

09:21.080 --> 09:22.920
Longwu Army, listen up!

09:23.000 --> 09:24.000
- Yes!
- Yes!

09:24.080 --> 09:27.200
Fight our way back to the capital
and wipe out rebels from the north!

10:08.400 --> 10:09.320
Xue Li,

10:11.040 --> 10:12.760
you still can't bear to kill me.

10:15.640 --> 10:17.200
You still love me.

10:17.280 --> 10:18.200
There's no love

10:19.760 --> 10:20.960
or hatred

10:22.760 --> 10:23.600
between us anymore.

10:24.360 --> 10:25.840
I just want to see you

10:26.560 --> 10:29.800
get your karma.

10:29.880 --> 10:31.520
If you want to see me get my karma,

10:34.280 --> 10:35.680
you should have killed me.

10:36.560 --> 10:37.960
Kill me,

10:38.040 --> 10:39.080
so I can pay you back

10:41.440 --> 10:43.200
everything I owe you.

10:43.720 --> 10:47.600
I'd have no regrets
if I die at your hands.

10:48.360 --> 10:51.960
Killing you would dirty my hands.

10:52.040 --> 10:53.880
You're a traitor to Great Yan.

10:53.960 --> 10:58.120
The law of Great Yan
should be the one to carry out your karma.

11:03.040 --> 11:04.040
Xue Li,

11:05.840 --> 11:07.160
back then,

11:08.560 --> 11:10.600
if I didn't become the top scorer

11:12.320 --> 11:15.760
and lived a good life with you
in Huaixiang instead,

11:17.800 --> 11:20.680
would we not have to go through all this?

11:21.760 --> 11:24.840
I, Shen Yurong, have only made

11:27.760 --> 11:29.600
one mistake in my life.

11:30.320 --> 11:34.560
But this one mistake leaves me
with no way to turn back anymore.

11:38.440 --> 11:39.480
Shen Yurong,

11:42.440 --> 11:43.680
in your next life,

11:45.560 --> 11:46.960
I hope you'll be born noble

11:48.880 --> 11:50.080
as you wish

11:52.320 --> 11:53.920
and be a good person.

15:16.280 --> 15:19.480
Zhao Ye, what kind of emperor
hides in there like you?

15:20.280 --> 15:22.120
You don't deserve to sit on that throne.

15:22.680 --> 15:25.480
Give up your throne
and I'll leave your body intact!

15:26.560 --> 15:28.840
Your Highness, the Longwu Army
have charged into the palace.

15:28.920 --> 15:30.000
Longwu Army?

15:30.840 --> 15:32.280
Shen Yurong is useless.

15:51.600 --> 15:53.080
Just surrender.

15:53.680 --> 15:56.840
Xiao Heng, you're better than your father.

15:57.400 --> 15:58.880
How dare you mention General Xiao?

15:58.960 --> 16:00.960
I'm going to avenge General Xiao

16:01.040 --> 16:03.160
and the fallen 100 Longwu soldiers today!

16:03.240 --> 16:04.200
- Attack!
- Attack!

16:06.120 --> 16:07.640
Now that you know all about it,

16:08.200 --> 16:09.600
you should know

16:10.360 --> 16:11.760
that he was the one who got in my way!

16:18.560 --> 16:21.240
In order to cover up your crime
of abandoning the people,

16:21.320 --> 16:23.760
you harmed my father,
abandoned him outside of Wang City,

16:23.840 --> 16:25.360
and blocked his way back to the city!

16:26.560 --> 16:29.240
You caused 100 Longwu soldiers
to die in vain!

16:29.320 --> 16:31.920
How can a man like you
be worthy of the throne?

16:32.000 --> 16:33.160
- Yang Qing!
- Yes!

16:33.240 --> 16:34.320
Arrest the traitors!

16:34.400 --> 16:35.440
Wait.

16:37.240 --> 16:38.280
Take her here.

16:45.200 --> 16:46.800
One more step

16:47.360 --> 16:48.320
and I'll kill her.

16:50.880 --> 16:52.640
This is Zhao Ye's favorite consort.

16:52.720 --> 16:54.480
I'll see who dares to do
anything reckless.

16:55.440 --> 16:58.520
Xiao Heng, tell Zhao Ye

16:58.600 --> 17:02.000
that next year, I'll make sure he dies.

17:05.760 --> 17:06.760
Duke Su,

17:08.079 --> 17:10.079
please don't tell His Majesty
about the palace maid.

17:11.160 --> 17:13.839
I'm taking this secret with me.

18:03.120 --> 18:07.400
Xiao Heng, you can't kill me.

18:08.160 --> 18:10.360
I'm your father's disciple.

18:11.000 --> 18:14.640
I'm his only disciple.

18:16.760 --> 18:18.840
I'm not my father.

18:20.560 --> 18:22.440
This sword in my hand

18:24.520 --> 18:26.760
doesn't know you!

19:03.000 --> 19:04.360
HENING GATE

19:04.440 --> 19:07.400
"Prince Cheng Zhao Sheng
colluded with Princess Wanning

19:07.480 --> 19:10.360
to kill loyal officials,
extort money from the people,

19:10.440 --> 19:12.920
commit bribery, and usurp the throne.

19:13.000 --> 19:15.200
These are grave crimes."

19:15.840 --> 19:17.000
After Prince Cheng's death,

19:17.560 --> 19:19.000
his remaining followers in the north

19:19.080 --> 19:20.800
started a rebellion in the name

19:20.880 --> 19:22.160
of seeking justice for him.

19:23.600 --> 19:24.600
Ye Shijie wrote a diatribe

19:24.680 --> 19:26.640
against Prince Cheng
and the Eldest Princess.

19:26.720 --> 19:27.640
COURT OF JUDICIAL REVIEW NOTICE

19:27.720 --> 19:29.440
In the name of suppressing rebels,

19:29.520 --> 19:32.040
the Imperial Court sent troops
to suppress the northern army.

19:33.640 --> 19:36.520
Li Zhongnan and his family
were arrested for treason

19:37.120 --> 19:38.120
and sentenced to death.

19:40.280 --> 19:42.120
- Go!
- Shen Yurong's assets were confiscated.

19:43.040 --> 19:45.640
His mother and Shen Ruyun,
who returned to their hometown,

19:45.720 --> 19:47.320
were arrested and questioned.

19:48.560 --> 19:51.280
Jiang Yuanxing and his family
are removed from the Jiang family tree.

19:51.360 --> 19:52.800
- Mother!
- Mother!

19:52.880 --> 19:55.560
Don't kick us out, Mother!

19:56.280 --> 19:59.000
General Xiao orders Xiao Heng around
to serve him tea and drinks

19:59.840 --> 20:02.160
on the grounds that he was
seriously injured when saving me.

20:03.160 --> 20:06.360
The capital is finally at peace.

20:07.920 --> 20:10.160
TAIJI HALL

20:17.720 --> 20:24.200
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

20:27.040 --> 20:28.400
I heard

20:30.080 --> 20:31.760
she even left a message before she died.

20:32.640 --> 20:33.600
She asked me

20:36.360 --> 20:38.280
not to tell you about the palace maid.

20:46.080 --> 20:50.480
Your Majesty, the Longwu Army is ready.

20:52.960 --> 20:54.080
When are you going to depart?

20:54.160 --> 20:55.200
Two days later.

20:55.280 --> 20:57.080
Take all the troops
in the south of the city.

20:57.640 --> 21:00.080
And my imperial guards too.

21:00.640 --> 21:03.760
Since Prince Cheng is dead,
Dai will attack us in full force.

21:04.600 --> 21:08.120
I won't rest assured
if you only take the Longwu Army.

21:09.120 --> 21:10.880
I can't take
Great Yan's strongest forces away

21:10.960 --> 21:12.880
while Prince Cheng's followers
are still at large.

21:13.680 --> 21:14.520
Besides,

21:16.360 --> 21:17.880
my father protected Great Yan

21:19.840 --> 21:21.360
with only the Longwu Army.

21:21.880 --> 21:23.360
I can't lose to him.

21:40.760 --> 21:41.640
My lady,

21:42.120 --> 21:43.440
we've got good news.

21:43.520 --> 21:45.080
Magistrate Xue remembers everything now.

21:46.280 --> 21:47.240
You mean…

21:47.320 --> 21:48.760
He has come to his senses.

21:48.840 --> 21:50.200
He remembers all of us.

21:51.040 --> 21:52.000
Go and check on him.

21:52.080 --> 21:53.280
Mr. Xue Zhao is already inside.

22:23.280 --> 22:25.000
Xue Li has suffered.

22:25.560 --> 22:26.400
I'm unfilial.

22:28.840 --> 22:34.160
I caused you and Xue Zhao
a lot of suffering

22:34.720 --> 22:35.680
and injustice.

22:37.200 --> 22:38.840
It's all my fault.

22:39.840 --> 22:42.680
I'm sorry, Father.

22:44.200 --> 22:45.640
I'm sorry, Father.

22:46.160 --> 22:49.200
- No. It's not your fault.
- I'm sorry, Father.

22:49.280 --> 22:51.160
Get up quickly. Get up.

22:53.080 --> 22:54.040
I don't blame you.

22:55.720 --> 22:56.720
It's not your fault.

23:01.760 --> 23:03.280
After everything that happened,

23:04.600 --> 23:05.880
I realized

23:06.760 --> 23:09.840
that you're not the same little kid

23:11.240 --> 23:13.000
who was bullied in my memories.

23:14.080 --> 23:16.120
Even if a bigger obstacle comes your way,

23:16.200 --> 23:17.920
you'll be able to withstand it.

23:18.480 --> 23:19.800
Now that I've come to my senses,

23:20.400 --> 23:22.240
I won't let you suffer anymore.

23:22.800 --> 23:23.680
Father.

23:24.240 --> 23:26.120
When are we going back to Huaixiang?

23:31.120 --> 23:36.600
Father, we can't go back to Huaixiang yet

23:37.160 --> 23:39.600
because I'm still the second daughter
of the Jiang family.

23:40.480 --> 23:42.360
I haven't explained
this matter clearly yet.

23:43.960 --> 23:46.040
Father, I told you,
but you wouldn't believe me.

23:46.520 --> 23:47.840
Xue Li has my brother-in-law now.

23:47.920 --> 23:49.760
How can she be willing to go with us?

23:49.840 --> 23:50.760
Xue Zhao.

23:51.240 --> 23:52.600
All right.

23:54.000 --> 23:57.160
I've heard about Duke Su.

23:58.120 --> 23:59.240
Father.

23:59.800 --> 24:00.880
You've got good taste.

24:02.600 --> 24:04.000
He's a good man.

24:05.200 --> 24:08.520
Whatever you do, I will support you.

24:09.080 --> 24:11.720
Don't be afraid even if you failed once,

24:13.080 --> 24:16.160
and don't let that deter you.

24:17.120 --> 24:20.560
You have to forget
what happened and move on.

24:21.120 --> 24:24.640
No matter what, I have your back.

24:25.520 --> 24:26.360
All right.

24:38.240 --> 24:39.720
Mr. Xue has completely recovered?

24:42.400 --> 24:43.800
He even praised you.

24:44.360 --> 24:45.240
What did he say?

24:45.320 --> 24:46.480
He said…

24:50.040 --> 24:51.360
Ask him yourself later on.

24:52.880 --> 24:53.840
What about you?

24:57.400 --> 24:58.760
What is your plan for the future?

25:01.160 --> 25:02.000
Duke Su,

25:03.440 --> 25:07.920
your mansion is a bit shabby.
It's time for a renovation.

25:08.560 --> 25:10.160
Why are you suddenly talking about that?

25:10.720 --> 25:11.960
Take your time to figure it out.

25:15.440 --> 25:16.520
What do you mean?

25:17.880 --> 25:19.320
There is a man I love.

25:25.040 --> 25:26.480
And he is…

25:27.840 --> 25:29.000
right in front of me.

25:48.240 --> 25:50.720
Have I been ordering him around too much
in the past two days?

25:52.520 --> 25:53.840
Has he gone silly?

25:54.880 --> 25:56.840
- What could he be thinking?
- That's possible.

25:57.320 --> 25:59.160
- Do you think he's--
- You're the silly ones!

26:02.160 --> 26:03.320
Let me tell you.

26:05.080 --> 26:08.040
I need to renovate my mansion.

26:08.720 --> 26:10.160
Keep an eye on it.

26:11.160 --> 26:12.600
Why do you want to renovate it?

26:13.360 --> 26:17.840
Because I want to renovate it,
that's why I want to renovate it.

26:23.680 --> 26:30.680
TOMB OF JIANG LI, TOMB OF TONG'ER

26:37.040 --> 26:38.200
After deliberating it,

26:39.040 --> 26:40.640
this should be your favorite place.

27:09.440 --> 27:10.480
Miss.

27:24.880 --> 27:25.920
Li'er.

27:26.000 --> 27:28.080
Miss, thank you

27:29.160 --> 27:30.600
for clearing

27:31.200 --> 27:32.960
my ruined reputation.

27:33.600 --> 27:34.440
Li'er,

27:36.200 --> 27:38.640
I'd do what I promised you.

28:21.520 --> 28:22.640
The flowers are so beautiful.

29:13.120 --> 29:15.320
BEST WISHES

31:46.440 --> 31:48.360
EAST GATE

31:51.680 --> 31:54.760
CAPITAL OF YAN

32:38.280 --> 32:40.560
JIANG RESIDENCE

32:41.640 --> 32:45.160
I've already resigned from my post
with His Majesty today.

32:46.840 --> 32:50.480
I'm planning to leave the capital
the day after tomorrow to go to Yongzhou.

32:52.920 --> 32:54.400
What's your plan?

32:55.320 --> 32:56.840
I've married Xiao Heng.

32:58.840 --> 33:01.800
I'll wait for him at the Duke's Mansion.

33:01.880 --> 33:04.000
What if he can't make it back?

33:05.640 --> 33:06.760
If he can't make it back,

33:07.920 --> 33:10.280
I'll tie my hair and be a widow
for the rest of my life.

33:11.240 --> 33:14.120
But he promised me he'd come back.

33:15.320 --> 33:18.040
Then do as you wish.

33:40.240 --> 33:41.160
Father.

33:43.080 --> 33:44.280
There's something else

33:45.760 --> 33:47.120
I want to confess to you.

33:48.080 --> 33:49.760
Do you want to tell me

33:52.080 --> 33:53.760
that you're not Jiang Li,

33:55.680 --> 33:56.840
but…

33:59.560 --> 34:01.200
Xue Fangfei?

34:10.639 --> 34:12.120
Was Li'er

34:14.239 --> 34:15.719
in pain

34:17.040 --> 34:18.280
when she passed away?

34:22.360 --> 34:25.719
Did anyone stay by her side?

34:28.679 --> 34:29.880
When…

34:31.320 --> 34:32.600
she passed away,

34:35.040 --> 34:36.360
Tong'er and I

34:37.760 --> 34:39.440
were by her side.

34:40.320 --> 34:42.000
She passed away peacefully.

34:43.120 --> 34:44.480
She didn't suffer from any pain.

34:46.159 --> 34:48.159
She didn't suffer from sickness.

34:50.320 --> 34:56.080
I think she has already reunited
with Madam Ye.

34:57.760 --> 34:58.720
I hope

35:01.840 --> 35:06.400
that this matter stays between you and me.

35:07.320 --> 35:09.520
Don't tell anyone else.

35:11.240 --> 35:13.360
Your grandmother is old.

35:15.000 --> 35:16.560
She can't handle this news.

35:18.920 --> 35:20.120
I got it,

35:27.280 --> 35:28.160
Father.

35:31.920 --> 35:34.360
All right.

36:28.400 --> 36:35.400
MORAL EXCELLENCE

36:41.760 --> 36:45.000
LEISURELY AND ELEGANT RESIDENCE

36:47.200 --> 36:48.040
JIANG RESIDENCE

36:48.120 --> 36:49.160
Jiang Li,

36:49.240 --> 36:51.840
Duke Su won't be back soon.

36:51.920 --> 36:54.560
Why don't you come with us
to Yongzhou first?

36:54.640 --> 36:56.680
Yes, have you thought this through?

36:56.760 --> 36:57.760
Come with us.

36:58.280 --> 37:00.080
What's the fun of staying
in the capital by yourself?

37:00.160 --> 37:02.200
Also, Ruoyao is waiting

37:02.280 --> 37:03.760
to meet us in Yongzhou.

37:04.360 --> 37:05.960
I've heard she has improved a lot lately.

37:06.440 --> 37:07.880
She'll surely show off in front of me.

37:08.680 --> 37:10.680
Jiang Li, if you're not around,

37:10.760 --> 37:12.000
I'm afraid I can't beat her.

37:12.880 --> 37:14.160
Come with us.

37:14.240 --> 37:15.120
You guys go first.

37:15.760 --> 37:18.400
When you two are settled in Yongzhou,

37:18.480 --> 37:19.800
I'll go and visit you.

37:19.880 --> 37:21.920
All right. Stop trying to persuade her.

37:22.920 --> 37:25.320
Li'er has her own ideas.

37:25.920 --> 37:28.720
Take good care of yourself in the capital.

37:28.800 --> 37:31.320
If you need anything, write to me anytime.

37:31.880 --> 37:32.720
Uncle Yuanping,

37:33.720 --> 37:34.560
Aunt Lu,

37:36.560 --> 37:37.400
take care.

37:37.960 --> 37:38.880
Take care of yourself too.

37:45.320 --> 37:46.280
Shijie.

37:46.360 --> 37:51.640
JIANG RESIDENCE

37:51.720 --> 37:52.560
My good buddy,

37:53.640 --> 37:55.120
thanks for seeing me off.

37:58.120 --> 38:00.080
- Take care.
- Take care.

38:00.640 --> 38:01.680
I'll miss you.

38:01.760 --> 38:02.720
Take care.

38:05.960 --> 38:06.960
Let's go.

38:10.240 --> 38:11.080
Jiang Jingrui,

38:12.560 --> 38:13.560
take good care of Liu Xu.

38:14.120 --> 38:16.160
Don't worry. Let's go.

38:19.160 --> 38:20.000
We'll get going.

38:22.360 --> 38:23.240
Be careful.

38:23.320 --> 38:30.240
JIANG RESIDENCE

38:31.840 --> 38:34.680
Grandmother, take care.

38:36.720 --> 38:40.600
Now, just do whatever you want.

38:41.160 --> 38:42.160
Just remember,

38:42.720 --> 38:46.120
if you have any problems,
come to us in Yongzhou.

38:51.920 --> 38:56.960
I also wish you
a prosperous life in Yongzhou.

38:57.880 --> 38:59.040
All the best.

38:59.920 --> 39:00.760
All right.

39:08.440 --> 39:09.600
Take good care of yourself.

39:18.040 --> 39:18.880
Father.

39:22.960 --> 39:24.240
Father.

39:26.320 --> 39:27.560
It's getting cold.

39:28.320 --> 39:29.480
Don't forget to wear more clothes.

39:30.120 --> 39:31.760
Don't catch a cold.

39:41.600 --> 39:43.040
You're going back to Duke's Mansion,
aren't you?

39:43.640 --> 39:44.720
I'll give you a ride.

39:47.120 --> 39:48.680
- I…
- Mr. Jiang has left the capital,

39:49.480 --> 39:50.520
but I'm still here.

39:51.840 --> 39:54.840
If you need anything in the future,
you can come to me anytime.

39:55.320 --> 39:57.200
- You know I'm not…
- My cousin.

39:59.120 --> 40:00.400
You don't have an elder brother.

40:01.640 --> 40:03.800
Think of me as your own elder brother
from now on.

40:11.800 --> 40:12.640
My brother.

40:18.600 --> 40:19.440
Let's go.

40:19.520 --> 40:20.360
All right.

40:21.360 --> 40:28.360
JIANG RESIDENCE

40:58.040 --> 40:58.920
Must you go?

40:59.480 --> 41:02.280
Prince Cheng has been eliminated
and Dai has amassed a huge army,

41:02.360 --> 41:04.680
thinking it's the best time
to invade Great Yan.

41:04.760 --> 41:07.880
We have to confront them head-on
and break their delusion.

41:14.000 --> 41:16.720
Only when the nation is safe
and the people are well

41:17.360 --> 41:19.040
will we be happy.

41:19.760 --> 41:20.840
When will you be back?

41:23.840 --> 41:25.560
The day the wintersweet blossoms

41:25.640 --> 41:27.960
will be the day
I safely return in triumph.

42:50.720 --> 42:57.280
PLANTED WITH MY WIFE
ON SPRING, MAY OF THE 13TH YEAR

43:01.880 --> 43:08.200
- Kill!
- Kill!

44:09.640 --> 44:13.400
- Kill!
- Kill!

44:45.000 --> 44:46.360
Lu Ji!

44:52.800 --> 44:54.520
Lu Ji!

46:00.520 --> 46:04.520
Lu Ji!

46:13.440 --> 46:14.840
I'll bring you home!

46:15.880 --> 46:17.600
I'll take you home!

47:21.480 --> 47:22.800
Wen Ji!

47:23.960 --> 47:25.040
Wen Ji!

47:37.280 --> 47:38.120
Wen Ji!

47:39.400 --> 47:40.240
Wen Ji.

47:40.320 --> 47:41.520
Wen Ji!

47:58.760 --> 48:00.360
I'll bring you both home.

48:05.680 --> 48:08.640
Don't shoot him!
I want to capture Xiao Heng alive!

50:56.520 --> 51:03.520
RETURN TO THE CLOUDS

51:59.600 --> 52:00.720
When will you be back?

52:01.960 --> 52:03.320
The day the wintersweet blossoms

52:04.320 --> 52:06.400
will be the day
I safely return in triumph.

52:15.840 --> 52:18.640
PLANTED WITH MY WIFE ON SPRING,
MAY OF THE 13TH YEAR
